{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14231250","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14231250","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1423125001:1":{"text":"마력을 주입한 천청광으로 만든 물건이에요. 마음에 드나요?","source_cn":"看看注魔后的天青矿锻造出的成品，还满意吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3EAC5868B0DDA4BF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1423125002:1":{"text":"음, 어디 보자... 확, 확실히 깊은바위 수정으로 만든 게 아니란 말이지?","source_cn":"嗯……我看看。这、这确定不是用深岩晶锻造的吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x661BBBCA07D39C7E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:2::2":{"text":"","source_cn":"","status":"matched_item_resource","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1423125003:1":{"text":"테고다, 하카. 와서 한 번 봐봐.","source_cn":"铁哥达，哈卡，你们也来看看。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x165D038CD8EBB07A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1423125004:1":{"text":"이야, 철을 이렇게 쉽게 베다니. 이거 보검이네요! 날카롭고 탄성도 아주 좋습니다.","source_cn":"好一把削铁如泥的宝剑！既锋利，又韧性十足！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x88A4E422138A2001","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say